            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kapedo ayoŋ alimun ŋuna a ŋikalalak, nai emam ayoŋ apaki ŋina limunet ŋuna a Gideon, ŋuna a Barak, ŋuna a Samsom, ŋuna a Yepesa, ŋuna a Daudi ka ŋuna a Samuel ta ŋuna a ŋikadwarak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anupit iŋes etijiyoto ikes ŋakwapin ŋuna gelae kilout. Apotu ikes towua aŋuna ka akiyookino, ido toryamut ŋuna eikinit Akuj. Apotu ikes kitubutasi ŋiŋatunyo ŋakituka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kituduŋeto ikes ŋakimya ŋuna ariraete nooi, tobucunos anatumyo. Apalag ikes, nai apotu togogoŋioto; ajioko ikes nooi akilo, tobwaŋa ŋajorei a ŋakwapin a ŋunace. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anupit iŋes aponiata ŋaberu toryamuniata nabo ŋiyeneta kec ŋulu sek atwakito, anerae aponi kiteyarunae.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ŋice towuout alacakino, ido kisicanae totwaka, anerae acamito ikes akiteyaruno nakiyar ŋina ajokan adepar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aponi ŋice tojamuwarae ka kibuŋae, torocae a ŋiriko, yaarae mabus. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aponi tocakae a ŋamoru, totubutuboe, toarae a ŋatumio. Apotu ikes kirimo akwap enapito ŋilowi ŋulu a ŋakinei--arae ikes ŋikaŋican, ŋulu aponi kisicanae ka tobolyanakinae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ajokak ŋituŋa ŋul nooi, pa etemokino eyakasi nakwap. Apotu ikes kirimo analoŋisae ka alokamukumukui esibito ŋikadoiunok a iwace, eboiyete anaturukanin ka anaduyon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
